  "body": "<p>The Library of Nuru is part of the <a href=\"#tower-of-gael\">Tower of Gael</a>. Its value lies in people returning to read, copy, compare and prepare together. It is distinct from the <a href=\"#pristinia-scroll-library\">Pristinia Scroll Library</a> and the memory book at the Veiled Watch.</p>\n<h2 id=\"nuru-library-copying\">A collection put to use</h2>\n<p>The early catalogue offers spells across several levels. Quake spends repeated visits copying from it, first with spare reagents and later with purchased supplies. The room is a place of work and reunion: Adelia finds Nienna there, frustrated over her books, after returning to the unfamiliar Tower.</p><p class=\"source-note\">Scene references: <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1250338434275348532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1250604935687700511\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1252315528760918016\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1255002907330482267\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1266409789487976528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1266410991877357598\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"nuru-library-limits\">Research that keeps its limits</h2>\n<p>In October, <a href=\"#scribonia\">Scribonia</a> searches for Saturnia and the history of Mage’s Ruin. He finds references and a surviving quotation, while the narrator explicitly says the ancient primary sources are absent from this library. A trace to follow is not a recovered complete history.</p><p><a href=\"#minerva\">Minerva</a> also researches questions raised by her travels. Her impression of being watched and her unanswered appeal do not identify a presence or establish why it remains silent. The collection does not become omniscient because its readers are capable.</p><p class=\"source-note\">Scene references: <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560103557103886408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560312973602455745\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560314210808889496\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560335212435607705\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560335338214396017\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"nuru-library-exchange\">Sharing knowledge before an expedition</h2>\n<p><a href=\"#fenwick\">Fenwick</a> and Scribonia exchange access to their spellbooks; Fenwick begins copying Chain Lightning, while Scribonia chooses Scatter and True Sight from Fenwick’s collection. Food delivered by Fenwick’s simulacrum sustains the quieter work.</p><p>Minerva offers to help explore Mage’s Ruin. Scribonia says he will breach its lead layer after gathering a party. Fenwick offers support while respecting Scribonia’s connection to the site. These are preparations; no completed breach, clearance or restoration is shown here. Fenwick later leaves a copy of his developing Verdelune field guide in the collection; its deposit does not independently verify every conclusion in that guide.</p><p class=\"source-note\">Scene references: <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560120164425404509\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560364850322866318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560365695651418113\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560367885207998580\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560369458650939545\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1560390115828834457\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1562225553455456317\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"nuru-library-veilguard\">A welcome to the Veilguard</h2>\n<p>On 23 October 2026, <a href=\"#lady-severina\">Lady Severina</a> asks Fenwick to join the <a href=\"#veilguard\">Veilguard</a>. He asks how its purpose serves Gael, whether noncombat work has value and whether he can remain an Ale-Chemy Knight. She explicitly accepts his continuing affiliation and formally welcomes him.</p><p>The exchange makes the library a place where research becomes an obligation to other people. Severina describes equality and mutual help as principles, while Fenwick offers his knowledge and asks what she needs. The welcome is witnessed; the future campaigns and requested relics remain work ahead.</p><p class=\"source-note\">Scene references: <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563208080345276487\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563210268803207199\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563217526144630837\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563218481040728215\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563220075656511548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563221394471518220\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1250338434275348532/1563223876782133430\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7</a>.</p>",
